# Safe for the browser — publishable/anon key only, never the service role
# key. Committed (unlike .env) because these values are meant to be public:
# Vite bakes them into the built JS bundle, and the anon key is designed to
# be exposed to the browser (Postgres RLS is what actually protects data).
